	<name>First Successful Launch</name>
	<visibility>0</visibility>
	<description><![CDATA[
    <b>Complete decoded Aug. 7 LOCUS flight package.</b><br/>
    Solid lines are recorded GPS fixes. Red connectors mark periods with no GPS records.
    Every available fix is timestamped and retained.
  ]]></description>
