			<description><![CDATA[<div style='font-family:Arial,sans-serif;min-width:280px'><h2 style='margin:0 0 10px 0'>Lucerne Balloon Flight</h2><table style='border-collapse:collapse;width:100%'><tr><td style='padding:4px 10px 4px 0;color:#666'><b>Launch area</b></td><td style='padding:4px 0'>34.501472, -116.962471</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:4px 10px 4px 0;color:#666'><b>Last pre-launch fix</b></td><td style='padding:4px 0'>Aug 07, 2026 12:39:40 PM PDT</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:4px 10px 4px 0;color:#666'><b>Peak logged altitude</b></td><td style='padding:4px 0'>31,761 m / 104,203 ft</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:4px 10px 4px 0;color:#666'><b>Peak time</b></td><td style='padding:4px 0'>Aug 07, 2026 04:57:05 PM PDT</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:4px 10px 4px 0;color:#666'><b>Final logged fix</b></td><td style='padding:4px 0'>Aug 07, 2026 06:18:51 PM PDT</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:4px 10px 4px 0;color:#666'><b>Flight span</b></td><td style='padding:4px 0'>5h 39m 11s</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:4px 10px 4px 0;color:#666'><b>Recorded flight fixes</b></td><td style='padding:4px 0'>687</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:4px 10px 4px 0;color:#666'><b>All Aug. 7 fixes</b></td><td style='padding:4px 0'>930</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:4px 10px 4px 0;color:#666'><b>Recorded path distance</b></td><td style='padding:4px 0'>91.5 km / 56.9 mi</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:4px 10px 4px 0;color:#666'><b>Launch-to-final displacement</b></td><td style='padding:4px 0'>158.9 km / 98.7 mi</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:4px 10px 4px 0;color:#666'><b>Detected GPS gaps</b></td><td style='padding:4px 0'>9</td></tr></table><p style='margin-top:10px;color:#555'>GPS gaps are kept visible. No missing section is drawn as if it were measured.</p></div>]]></description>
